In debug builds, testcontrol retires an old node key after either an interactive
followup or a registration that requires no authorization. Upstream retires it
only after a followup, leaving duplicate peers after noninteractive key rotation.
Replace its nested "if isFollowup" with "if isFollowup || !s.RequireAuth".

